 "meta": {
  "hi": {
   "title": "Airplane hawa mein kaise udta hai?",
   "description": "Kya aapne kabhi socha hai ki itna bhaari airplane hawa mein kaise tairta rehta hai? Iska seedha connection Bernoulli's principle aur pressure difference se hai. Lekin asli science kuch aur hi kehti hai jo hum sabko pata honi chahiye.\n\nIs short video mein hum step-by-step samjhenge ki wing ka shape kaise lift create karta hai. Yeh invisible force hi plane ko upar hold karti hai. Agar yeh mechanism fail ho jaye, toh flight possible nahi hai.\n\nScience ke aise aur simple secrets samajhne ke liye, please subscribe to Merit Mantra.",
   "hashtags": "#MeritMantra, #Science, #Aviation, #Physics, #Bernoulli, #Lift, #Airplane, #Shorts, #Learn, #Hinglish, #ScienceExplained, #Reels, #STEM, #Curiosity, #AviationScience",
   "instagram": "Airplane hawa mein kaise udta hai?\nWings sirf hawa ko neeche nahi dhakelti.\nSubscribe to Merit Mantra for more simple science!\n#MeritMantra #Science #Aviation #Physics #Shorts #Learn #Hinglish #Reels #STEM #Curiosity"
  },
